License: LGPL-2.0-only
 The ONLY signal in this directory is its bundled COPYING.LIB (the same
 stale "Library GPL v2" text as apogee's and sbig's) -- unlike the eight
 directories above, no source file here carries a licence header of its
 own, so there is no "or later" grant to upgrade the tag with. The
 conservative, defensible reading is the plain v2 text as written.

